pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |
  明确评审范围与硬约束：峰值吞吐、延迟、可靠性和回滚能力是验收标准；外部契约与团队预算不可变。
elements:
  - elementId: section-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 36, 3, 26]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$accent" }

  - elementId: section-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 38, 360, 22]
    content:
      style: "$eyebrow"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 01 / 目标与约束

  - elementId: page-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 38, 92, 22]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "02 / 07"

  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 70, 864, 42]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 目标：促销峰值 2,400 单/秒下，写确认 P95 低于 400ms

  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 116, 864, 24]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 评审范围、成功标准与硬约束。所有指标为示例目标，正式评审请替换为压测与业务口径。

  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 150, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: left-heading
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 166, 380, 26]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Smiley Sans"
      fontSize: 16
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 成功标准（SLO）

  - elementId: s1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 202, 380, 30]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong><span style="color:$primary;">T1</span></strong>　峰值吞吐 ≥ 2,400 单/秒</p>

  - elementId: s1-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 238, 380, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: s2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 244, 380, 30]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong><span style="color:$primary;">T2</span></strong>　写确认延迟 P95 ≤ 400ms</p>

  - elementId: s2-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 280, 380, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: s3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 286, 380, 30]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong><span style="color:$primary;">T3</span></strong>　查询延迟 P95 ≤ 120ms</p>

  - elementId: s3-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 322, 380, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: s4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 328, 380, 30]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong><span style="color:$primary;">T4</span></strong>　可靠性 RPO ≤ 1s，RTO ≤ 30min</p>

  - elementId: s4-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 364, 380, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: s5
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 370, 380, 30]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong><span style="color:$primary;">T5</span></strong>　灰度期间一键回滚 ≤ 5min</p>

  - elementId: s5-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 406, 380, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: right-heading
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 166, 412, 26]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Smiley Sans"
      fontSize: 16
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 边界与约束

  - elementId: c1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 202, 412, 30]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong><span style="color:$accent;">C1</span></strong>　不改动支付 / 库存 / 履约外部接口契约</p>

  - elementId: c1-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [500, 238, 412, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: c2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 244, 412, 30]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong><span style="color:$accent;">C2</span></strong>　保持 MySQL 为主存储，不引入新数据库引擎</p>

  - elementId: c2-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [500, 280, 412, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: c3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 286, 412, 30]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong><span style="color:$accent;">C3</span></strong>　团队 8 人，实施周期 ≤ 6 个月</p>

  - elementId: c3-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [500, 322, 412, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: c4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 328, 412, 30]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong><span style="color:$accent;">C4</span></strong>　年度新增基础设施成本 ≤ 180 万元</p>

  - elementId: c4-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [500, 364, 412, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: c5
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 370, 412, 30]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong><span style="color:$accent;">C5</span></strong>　不在本方案内重构商品与库存模型</p>

  - elementId: c5-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [500, 406, 412, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 424, 864, 90]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>假设：2026 年大促峰值按近三年峰值年复合增速 22% 推演，取 2,400 单/秒。</p>
        <p>待补：正式评审需补充业务方确认的峰值预测、SLA 违约口径与成本归属。</p>
